WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:03.000
Speaker 1: We have an incredible bit of news.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.610
The White House called a Trump rioter on January
6th.

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:10.509
Uh oh.

00:00:10.509 --> 00:00:11.900
Why would that be the case?

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.099
Well, let's see if we can figure this out.

00:00:14.099 --> 00:00:21.090
But this is blowing the lid off of yet another
part of the Trump riot investigation.

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:23.910
There's a CNN article that summarizes this
quite well.

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:25.250
Listen to this.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:31.630
On January 6th at 4:34 p.m., a cell phone
registered to a Capitol riot, a rioter who

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:36.790
stormed the Capitol, got a phone call from
a White House landline.

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:38.579
CNN has obtained the records.

00:00:38.579 --> 00:00:40.120
Other news outlets have looked at the records.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:41.580
This happened.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:42.650
White House calls.

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:45.180
Calls a Trump rioter on January six.

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:48.829
The call lasts 9 seconds.

00:00:48.829 --> 00:00:50.410
Who placed the call from the White House?

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:53.690
Well, we don't know right now because the
White House has landlines and many people

00:00:53.690 --> 00:00:54.690
work at the White House.

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:55.690
So we don't know.

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:57.850
Could have been anybody who works at the White
House.

00:00:57.850 --> 00:00:58.850
Okay.

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.360
According to the records, the call came from
a two OTU number, which is the publicly available

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:07.750
number for the White House, doesn't show a
specific extension, so we don't know who's

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:09.350
whose phone it came from.

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:13.770
The call was placed in the late afternoon
right after Trump did the video message, saying

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:17.380
to the rioters, We love you but go home.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:18.450
It's unclear.

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:23.060
CNN writes What, if any, connection exists
between the White House and the rioter, including

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:27.930
whether the call was made by mistake and whether
the call went to voicemail.

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:28.930
Mistake.

00:01:28.930 --> 00:01:32.299
That'd be quite a coincidental wrong number.

00:01:32.299 --> 00:01:35.250
Quite a coincidental wrong number.

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:36.360
What else do we know about it?

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:39.180
Well, we know who the call was made to.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:44.560
The cell phone belonged to a 26 year old Trump
supporter from Brooklyn, New York, named Anton

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:50.060
Larnach, who traveled to D.C. the night before
with two friends, according to multiple sources

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:52.380
familiar with the investigation.

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:56.970
The three men attended the Stop the Steal
rally on the Ellipse, and then with hundreds

00:01:56.970 --> 00:02:01.659
of others entered and illegally demonstrated
inside the Capitol.

00:02:01.659 --> 00:02:03.009
They were charged.

00:02:03.009 --> 00:02:08.830
They pleaded guilty in April, and they were
sentenced earlier this month.

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:12.020
All three declined to comment to CNN.

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:16.911
According to multiple sources, Lennox says
he doesn't remember getting that 9/2 call

00:02:16.911 --> 00:02:22.340
from the White House and says he doesn't know
anyone who worked in the Trump White House.

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:27.680
The phone call wasn't mentioned in Lennox
sentencing or in any court documents.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:32.069
And a spokesman for the U.S. attorney's office
in D.C. has declined to comment.

00:02:32.069 --> 00:02:35.540
So what exactly does this mean?

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:37.390
And there are a number of questions here.

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:42.240
Number one, how do you not remember a phone
call from the White House that you didn't

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:47.080
get the call or you got it, but you don't
remember what was said or they left you a

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:48.310
voicemail or what?

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:49.770
You have no memory of it.

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:53.140
That's different than I never received such
a call.

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:54.570
I have no memory of it.

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:56.300
It's really weird.

00:02:56.300 --> 00:03:01.620
It's obviously very difficult to believe that
it's a random coincidence there's a riot going

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:02.739
on.

00:03:02.739 --> 00:03:07.140
Trump says to the rioters that he loves them,
but it's time to go home.

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:10.490
One of the rioters is at the Capitol.

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:11.490
And the White House.

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:12.490
It's like a dial.

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:15.440
Someone just happens to accidentally call
the phone of the writer.

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:16.810
Doesn't really make sense.

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:18.990
So it obviously leads to speculation.

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:19.990
Could it be?

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:25.390
Well, someone at the White House was in touch
with this writer, meant to call the writer

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:29.269
on their cell phone, but realized they were
using the White House line.

00:03:29.269 --> 00:03:30.520
And so they quickly hung up.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:31.520
Is that a possibility?

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:35.230
Again, we're left to speculate because the
official explanation so far don't make absolutely

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:36.800
any sense.

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:42.159
This particular writer, Linick, was seen in
the background of an individual named Baked

00:03:42.159 --> 00:03:46.800
Alaska live stream from Jeff Merkley's office
on January six.

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:49.110
They'd broken into Jeff Merkley's office.

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:53.349
You can see in the background of a baked Alaska
live stream, is it possible someone at the

00:03:53.349 --> 00:03:55.629
White House was watching the stream?

00:03:55.629 --> 00:04:00.310
Saw Linick was like, Oh, that's the guy we've
been in touch with or I know that guy or something.

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:06.080
The other speculation is Linick agreed to
cooperate to some degree for a lighter sentence.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:08.459
Is that related to why?

00:04:08.459 --> 00:04:14.099
There seems to be no comment from anybody
and not much of a desire seemingly to get

00:04:14.099 --> 00:04:16.919
to the bottom of who it is from the White
House that called linick.

00:04:16.919 --> 00:04:23.159
Only questions right now, but the fact that
someone from the White House called this guy

00:04:23.159 --> 00:04:29.580
on the day of the riots raises all new sets
of questions about the connections between

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:32.189
the Trump White House and the rioters.

00:04:32.189 --> 00:04:33.189
Not generally, right?

00:04:33.189 --> 00:04:36.289
Of course, you can say, well, generally they
were like, we'll make a speech and we'll say,

00:04:36.289 --> 00:04:39.759
let's walk down to Pennsylvania that walk
down Pennsylvania Avenue and some of these

00:04:39.759 --> 00:04:40.889
people are going to follow.

00:04:40.889 --> 00:04:41.889
Okay, fine.

00:04:41.889 --> 00:04:47.050
We knew that this is about the specific connection
between an individual at the White House and

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:50.539
this particular rioter on that exact day.

00:04:50.539 --> 00:04:51.819
Will we ever know what happened?

00:04:51.819 --> 00:04:53.240
I think we actually will.

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:56.259
I think it's likely that we will get to the
bottom of this.

00:04:56.259 --> 00:05:00.849
Multiple news agencies working on it, but
it doesn't look good.

00:05:00.849 --> 00:05:05.080
What do you believe is the explanation for
this phone call?

